    "Id": "chassisdef_mistlynx_MLX-A",
    "Name": "Mist Lynx -- Koshi",
    "Details": "Weighing in at twenty five tons, the Mist Lynx is a lightweight workhorse OmniMech. The Mist Lynx is built on a lightweight Endo Steel chassis and a XL engine to save weight. The Mist Lynx also has six Jump Jets and a fixed Active Probe. For protection, the Mist Lynx has three and a half tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. The A configuration of the Mist Lynx is intended for artillery spotting and anti-infantry work. To spot for Arrow IV artillery, it carries a TAG laser designator. To protect itself from infantry attacks, it has two A-Pods, two Machine Guns, and a single Flamer. Finally, for added protection from missile attacks, the Mist Lynx A has two Anti-Missile Systems.",
    "Icon": "MistLynx"
  },
